{"id": 14, "ts": 1780583015.7148232, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 1, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I\u2019m less convinced by Candidate\u202fB as the top choice because, while his conscientiousness and stress handling are solid, his weak memory for numbers raises a direct concern for attention and accuracy on long\u2011haul flights where precise calculations are critical. Moreover, we still have no evidence of his decision quality in safety\u2011critical situations. In contrast, Candidate\u202fC has a clear strength: he \u201cmakes correct decisions quickly\u201d and \u201ckeeps calm in a crisis,\u201d directly addressing decision quality and stress resilience\u2014core safety criteria for international routes. Although C\u2019s communication style and egocentric attitude are concerns, the evidence we have shows his decision\u2011making capability is superior to B\u2019s, and the communication issues could be mitigated with crew\u2011resource\u2011management training. Therefore, I would provisionally recommend Candidate\u202fC."}
