{"id": 29, "ts": 1780583697.860196, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I agree with Emily\u2019s provisional vote for Candidate\u202fC. The panel consistently highlights C\u2019s flawless reliability, rapid correct decision\u2011making, and the positive atmosphere he creates with his crew\u2014core safety attributes for long\u2011haul operations. While we lack a concrete observation of his numerical accuracy (James confirmed no specific data), the existing note that C \u201chas excellent attention skills\u201d still suggests a solid baseline for handling detailed information. The concerns about his communication style, egocentric attitude, and limited drive for further education are real, but these are addressable through targeted CRM and professional\u2011development programs. Compared with the other candidates\u2014B\u2019s documented weak memory for numbers and uncooperative demeanor, A\u2019s organizational and criticism\u2011handling issues, and D\u2019s arrogance and weak leadership\u2014the overall risk profile of C remains the most favorable. Therefore, I keep my provisional recommendation for Candidate\u202fC."}
